---
import Layout from "@/layouts/page.astro";
---

<Layout title="Leadership">
  <section class="px-6 pb-16 md:px-0 md:pb-0">
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1440px] md:h-[1033px]">
      <h1 class="font-heading pt-32 text-center text-[clamp(36px,4.71vw,67.84px)] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-1.36px] md:absolute md:left-[43px] md:right-[43px] md:top-[207px] md:pt-0">
        Our Leadership Team
      </h1>
      <img
        src="/images/pages/jrg5865-full.webp"
        alt="Chris Hughes, Senior Pastor"
        class="mx-auto mt-10 w-full max-w-[614px] md:absolute md:left-[782px] md:top-[388px] md:mx-0 md:mt-0 md:h-[631px] md:w-[614px] md:max-w-none md:object-cover"
      />
      <div class="mt-12 md:absolute md:left-[43px] md:top-[611px] md:mt-0 md:w-[614px]">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-[clamp(30px,3.27vw,47.104px)] leading-[1.11] tracking-[-0.94px]">
          Chris Hughes<br />
          <span class="relative inline-block">
            Senior Pastor
            <span
              class="absolute -bottom-[2px] left-0 h-[5px] w-full bg-[hsl(83,48%,47%)]"
              aria-hidden="true"
            ></span>
          </span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-6 md:mt-[33px]">
          In his 20’s, Chris had a crisis of faith which led him on a
          journey to find “truth”. This search landed on the Truth
          of Christ Jesus and his life has never been the same since. He firmly
          believes, ”if Jesus is who He says He is, then this is the most
          important message in all of history”. He has given his life to
          preaching the Gospel, making disciples, and loving his wife and son.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
